  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Mg</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>Mg</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><munderover><mo>→</mo><mi>moist</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>Mg</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>OH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ca</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>Ca</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><munderover><mo>→</mo><mi>moist</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>Ca</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Li</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>Li</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><munderover><mo>→</mo><mi>moist</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></munderover><mi>LiOH</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo></math> no reaction<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>→</mo></math> no reaction<br />Hence, Sodium and Potassium do not give smell of ammonia.",
